0); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h1 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-2a357ebc-f875-4d07-ba77-2a11a28846d5\" data-identifyelement=\"669\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 2em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"623\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Key Highlights</strong></span></span></h1><p data-identifyelement=\"674\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"625\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. This calendar enables contacts to make<span>&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"675\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">bookings</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>for<span>&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"676\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">multiple services</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>for themselves or combine services for multiple participants (themselves and their<span>&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"677\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">guests</strong>).</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"678\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"626\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"679\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"627\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">2. The calendar operates with a default<span>&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"680\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">15-minute slot interval</strong>, which ensures efficient scheduling. While this interval is fixed, you have the flexibility to<span>&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"681\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">add buffer times</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>between appointments, giving your staff the time they need to prepare for the next client.</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"682\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"628\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"683\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"684\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"629\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">3. Crucially, the<span>&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"685\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">availability</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>of the service calendar is directly<span>&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"686\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">linked</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>to the schedules of the<span>&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"687\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">staff members</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>assigned to it. Hence, there is no option to configure the Calendar Availability. The calendar will consider the availability of only it's assigned staff members. If a staff member is unavailable at a given time, the calendar will reflect this unavailability.</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"688\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"630\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"689\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"690\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"631\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">4. If you wish to display<span>&nbsp;</span><strong data-identifyelement=\"691\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">different services</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>on a single scheduling link (<strong data-identifyelement=\"692\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">T</strong><strong data-identifyelement=\"693\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">he Service Menu</strong>), it is important to first create the desired groups, then create your service calendars and assign them to the respective groups, and finally create your Service Menu.</span></span></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006358-activity-cards-in-conversations", "title": "Activity Cards in Conversations", "folder": "Conversations View", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054096750/original/vb5YsKuW5gAOlg1mm9LV_AzcXatfwTB-Lg8856.png?1758249121", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054096751/original/ODQbVZgqocNfVI26Z2wZJJsp6Dsb2ibCmQ8856.jpg?1758249121", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054096748/original/txcosKE_isAhGWqwHMXiX1WjF7nixZi98gd1dd.jpg?1758249120", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054096747/original/Fa6827UXZPOm5EMY6eFbT_B224VVnmMZdgd1dd.png?1758249120", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054096746/original/eCW4VdsgJhlXzlJU9fE4cdGS96wPFhocuwd1dd.png?1758249120", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054096749/original/77_DGo5lNKvwpg2FrqFWudAycB-_QQwBKgd1dd.png?1758249120", "../../../../s3.am