\"BOX\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; -webkit-box-align: start; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\"><h2 class=\"css-16k5vxt\" data-paste-core-version=\"21.0.1\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(18, 28, 45); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; font-weight: 600; display: inline;\"><br></h2><h2 class=\"css-16k5vxt\" data-paste-core-version=\"21.0.1\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(18, 28, 45); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; font-weight: 600; display: inline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\">ERROR: 21612</span></strong></h2><hr></div><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Description</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Message cannot be sent with the current combination of \"To\" and/or \"From\" parameters.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Possible Causes</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Number formatting:</strong> The format you used for the \"To\" or \"From\" number may not be formatted using the <a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/docs/glossary/what-e164\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" target=\"_blank\">E.164 format.</a> LeadConnector standardises numbers using the E.164 format. If the \"To\" or \"From\" number of this message were altered by LeadConnector in a way that you didn't expect, try re-submitting the message with E.164 formatted addresses.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Destinations where LeadConnector does not have connectivity:</strong> It is possible that LeadConnector does not yet have service with the carrier you are trying to reach. Contact Support.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Sender ID restrictions in the destination country:</strong> Many countries limit which numbers, short-codes, and/or alphanumeric senders can be used in that region. Consult the <a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/en-us/guidelines/sms\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" target=\"_blank\">SMS guidelines for the destination region</a>.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Possible Solutions</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Consult the linked documentation for each cause. You can also try sending again with a different \"To\" and \"From\" combination.</span></p><div class=\"css-gt12nx\" data-paste-core-version=\"21.0.1\" data-paste-element=\"BOX\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; -webkit-box-align: start; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\"><a class=\"css-f02h4i\" data-paste-core-version=\"21.0.1\" data-paste-element=\"BOX\" href=\"https://www.twilio.com/docs/api/errors/21612#error-21612\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0.5rem; color: rgb(96, 107, 133); border-radius: 2px; display: inline-block;\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"css-p3p0nr\" data-paste-core-version=\"21.0.1\" data-paste-element=\"BOX\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; display: inline-flex; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: rgb(18, 28, 45); font-family: TwilioSansText, &quot;Inter var experimental&quot;, &quot;Inter var&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000002058-how-to-set-up-a-review-link-in-your-review-request-email", "title": "How to Set Up a Review Link in Your Review Request Email", "folder": "Review Management", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022685692/original/jVpvzsIDyIpTs-Fq-95-Y5-XTAAaUHQO-A9e03.png?1710226015", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022686141/original/4FFz2rQtJty6KTI8r9TPej26dGZ3RgXNdw075a.png?1710226602", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022686251/original/HkqyTXgLmXA_kQliWUWAMtscnXRX_Cw7zA51b4.png?1710226756"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<div class=\"text__content kbase-content__description\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;\"><span class=\"fr-view collab-annotatable\" data-test-id=\"article-description\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block; cursor: auto;\"><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-8dbb4682-29fa-4331-ad30-a176086afafb\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Sending review request emails is an essential part of gathering feedback and improving your business's reputation. Including a review link in these emails makes it easy for customers to leave feedback, but setting it up correctly is crucial. This guide will walk you through the steps to set up a review link in your review request email effectively.</p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Guide on How-to set up a Review Link</strong></p><ul><li><p><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Step-1%3A-%E2%80%8BAccess-Settings-in-Reputation-tab\">Step 1: Access Settings in Reputation tab</a><a href=\"#Step-2%3A%C2%A0%E2%80%8BSet-a-Review-Link-for-sending-out-Emails/SMS\" dir=\"ltr\"></a></p></li><li><p><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Step-2%3A%C2%A0%E2%80%8BSet-a-Review-Link-for-sending-out-Emails/SMS\">Step 2: Set a Review Link for sending out Emails/SMS</a><a href=\"#Step-3%3A%C2%A0%E2%80%8BSet-a-Review-Link-for-in-the-Email-Builder\" dir=\"ltr\"></a></p></li><li><p><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Step-3%3A%C2%A0%E2%80%8BSet-a-Review-Link-for-in-the-Email-Builder\">Step 3: Set a Review Link for in the Email Builder</a></p></li></ul><hr style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page;\"><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Step-1:-\u200bAccess-Settings-in-Reputation-tab\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 1:&nbsp;</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Access Settings in Reputation tab</strong></h3><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0801a83d-82c4-42dc-9c55-31b4686e89d7\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;\">Go to Reputation Tab in your sub-accounts and click on settings. You will see a section for setting up your Review Link.</div></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Step-2:&nbsp;\u200bSet-a-Review-Link-for-sending-out-Emails/SMS\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 2:&nbsp;</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Set a Review Link for sending out Emails/SMS</strong></h3><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0801a83d-82c4-42dc-9c55-31b4686e89d7\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;\">You can set up your review Link based on which platform you would need your reviews to be obtained from users - Google, Facebook, or a Custom Link</div></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0801a83d-82c4-42dc-9c55-31b4686e89d7\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;\">This Link will be the default link used in all your Review Requests sent via Email/SMS</div></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022685692/original/jVpvzsIDyIpTs-Fq-95-Y5-XTAAaUHQO-A9e03.png?1710226015\" style=\"width: 488px; display: block; float: none; vertical-align: top; margin: 5px auto; text-align: center;\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155022685692\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Step-3:&nbsp;\u200bSet-a-Review-Link-for-in-the-Email-Builder\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 3:&nbsp;</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Set a Review Link for in the Email Builder</strong></h3><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0801a83d-82c4-42dc-9c55-31b4686e89d7\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;\">Alternatively you can also go to the Email Review Requests section of Settings tab. Open Email Builder -&gt; Add a Button -&gt; Set the Link URL as {{reputation.review_link}}.</div></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\u200b\"><br><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022686141/original/4FFz2rQtJty6KTI8r9TPej26dGZ3RgXNdw075a.png?1710226602\" style=\"width: 509px; display: block; float: none; vertical-align: top; margin: 5px auto; text-align: center;\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155022686141\"></strong></h3><p><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155022686251/original/HkqyTXgLmXA_kQliWUWAMtscnXRX_Cw7zA51b4.png?1710226756\" style=\"width: 505px; display: block; float: none; vertical-align: top; margin: 5px auto; text-align: center;\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155022686251\"></strong><br></p><p><br></p><pre dir=\"ltr\">Note: You wont be able to send a review request without setting up a Review Link.\n\n</pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><br>By following these steps, you can seamlessly set up review links in your review request emails, streamlining the process for collecting valuable feedback from your customers.</p><hr style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: brea